-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">• Lead design workshops and translate business needs into ServiceNow solutions</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">• Define architecture standards, integration strategies, and governance models</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">• Oversee technical delivery, reviewing solution designs and ensuring compliance with best practices</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">• Serve as the primary technical authority and advisor to client stakeholders and executives</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">• Mentor developers, admins, and consultants across delivery teams</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36);font-s