    "text": "Hi,\n\n\nIf you find yourself comfortable with the requirement, please reply with\nyour updated resume and I will get back to you or I would really appreciate\nif you can give me a call back at my contact number (732)-837-3449\n\n*Role ServiceNow Certified Technical Architect (CTA)*\n*Duration 12+ Months*\n*Location Remote*\n\n*Visa*\n*US Citizen, Green Card*\n\n\n*About the job*\n\nResponsibilities\n\n• Lead design workshops and translate business needs into ServiceNow\nsolutions\n\n• Define architecture standards, integration strategies, and governance\nmodels\n\n• Oversee technical delivery, reviewing solution designs and ensuring\ncompliance with best practices\n\n• Serve as the primary technical authority and advisor to client\nstakeholders and executives\n\n• Mentor developers, admins, and consultants across delivery teams\n\n• Create technical roadmaps for platform adoption, upgrades, and new module\nrollouts\n\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver secure,\nenterprise-grade solutions\n\n\n\nQualifications\n\n•* Active certifications required: ServiceNow Certified Technical Architect\n(CTA) credential or ServiceNow CSA, CAD, and at least two CIS certification*\n\n• 10+ years of ServiceNow implementation experience in large, complex\nenvironments\n\n• Strong understanding of enterprise integration patterns, security, and\nplatform scalability\n\n• Experience engaging directly with senior stakeholders to explain\ntechnical trade-offs\n\n• Excellent communication, leadership, and client-facing skills\n\n\n\nPreferred Qualifications\n\n• Experience in consulting or working with global enterprises\n\n• Exposure to ITIL, Agile delivery, and enterprise architecture frameworks\n\n• Familiarity with ERP, HR, CRM, or security tool integrations\n",
